  m_text: <b>Seasonal River:</b> a river that flows only during specific seasons,
    typically the rainy season, and dries up in other seasons. These rivers are rain-fed
    and their flow is directly dependent on rainfall. It consist of three major parts-
    Rain-fed River (near the sources like Western Ghats, etc.), Seasonal Flow along
    the river course that dries up in summer and Delta formation at the mouth.
